# Redragon M690 PRO: Keyboard keys bound to the wheel click through the receiver (slot 3 = 21 <modifiers> <usage> 00),
# each followed by presses: the mouse sends keyboard report 1 (01 <modifiers> <usage> ..). In order:
# Ctrl+Shift+R (already bound), Alt+A, Win+W, A, \, Delete, Up arrow, F12, Numpad 5, Backspace.
EVT 01 03 15
GET 08 21 00 00 00 00 00 00 64 13 03 35 00 02 00 05 00 0e 00 13 00 18 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 ff 80 80 ff ff 00 00 ff 00 00 00 ff ff 80 c0 ff 46 00 00 ff ff ff ff ff 03 44 01 40 ff 00 00 44 07 00 00 00 00 ff 00 00 00 ff ff ff 00 00 ff ff ff 80 00 ff 00 ff 02 02 00 e9 5a ee 00 ff 00 00 00 ff ff ff 00 00 ff ff ff 80 00 ff 00 ff ff 00 00 ff 00 00 ff 00 00 02 00 ff 00 fa 03 6a 42 42 02 ff 00 00 00 00 01 02 ff 00 00 a5
GET 08 22 00 00 00 00 00 00 11 01 00 00 11 02 00 00 21 03 15 00 11 08 00 00 11 10 00 00 41 01 00 00 41 02 00 00 31 01 32 03 50 04 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01 00 00 50 01
GET 05 80 01 01
SET 08 21 00 92 ..  unchanged
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x11] 03 15 -> 04 04
EVT 01 04 04
GET 08 21 ..  identical to the write
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x11] 04 04 -> 08 1a
EVT 01 08 1a
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x11] 08 1a -> 00 04
EVT 01 00 04
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x12] 04 -> 31
EVT 01 00 31
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x12] 31 -> 4c
EVT 01 00 4c
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x12] 4c -> 52
EVT 01 00 52
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x12] 52 -> 45
EVT 01 00 45
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x12] 45 -> 5d
EVT 01 00 5d
SET 08 22 00 50 ..  [0x12] 5d -> 2a
EVT 01 00 2a
